msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Clear the screen: write the B<\\%clear_screen> capability's value to the "
"standard output stream."
